<title>FINLAND: RAUTARUUKKI WINS FIM 60 MLN WAGGON ORDER.</title>
<headline>RAUTARUUKKI WINS FIM 60 MLN WAGGON ORDER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish steel group Rautaruukki Oy said on Tuesday its Transtech unit had received an order for 100 railway waggons worth about 60 million markka in total from Swedish company Nordwaggon AB.</p>
<p>&quot;The value of the deal is about 60 million markka, and the deal also includes an option for an additional 100 waggons,&quot; Rautaruukki said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The waggons will be used by the Swedish steel industry, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
